\hline
Step & User action & System behavior \\ \hline
1 & User selects or creates a workout. & The app loads workout metadata, exercise list, and saved configuration. \\ \hline
2 & User starts a session. & A session state is initialized with start time, current exercise, set counters, and timer preferences. \\ \hline
3 & User completes sets. & The app records repetitions, weights, rest periods, and exercise completion state. \\ \hline
4 & Rest timer runs between sets. & Timer UI, haptics, audio cues, warning intervals, and auto-advance settings are applied. \\ \hline
5 & User finishes the workout. & Summary values are calculated and stored in workout sessions for \_ progress screens. \\ \hline
